#   lsc "*Voice cracking* I-I thought m-maybe my mind m-made it up."
    lsc "*Voz embargada* E-eu pensei que talvez minha mente tivesse inventado isso."

# game/script9.rpy:9420
translate brazil mcisback_f52ae321:

#   lsc "*Crying* I... I-I w-was so scared, I-I..."
    lsc "*Chorando* Eu... eu-eu estava com tanto medo, eu-eu..."

