#   mct "Damn, it's already 10. And I'm supposed to meet the girls at 10:30."
    mct "Droga, já são 10h. E devo encontrar as garotas às 10h30."

# game/script9.rpy:9697
translate brazil cafe09poshy_2c463f8b:

#   mct "Maybe I should text Chang to tell him I've gotta–"
    mct "Talvez eu devesse mandar uma mensagem para Chang dizendo que preciso–"

# game/script9.rpy:9706
