translate brazil ending09_44c668fd:

#   bla "You continue sharing laughs and quiet, comfortable moments with Luna on the train ride back until before you know it, you find yourselves back together in Kredon once more." with dis2
    bla "Você continua compartilhando risadas e momentos tranquilos e confortáveis ​​com Luna na viagem de trem de volta até que, antes que você perceba, vocês se encontram novamente em Kredon." with dis2

# game/script9.rpy:20838
translate brazil ending09_111ef0b9:

#   mc "Aw man... can't believe the day's already over."
    mc "Ah, cara... não acredito que o dia já acabou."

# game/script9.rpy:20839
translate brazil ending09_6f70f757:

#   l "I know... it went by way too fast."
    l "Eu sei... passou rápido demais."

# game/script9.rpy:20840
translate brazil ending09_c951392b:

#   mc "Definitely."
    mc "Definitivamente."

# game/script9.rpy:20842
translate brazil ending09_2b48aa42:

#   mc "But hey, look at it this way. This was just the first date of many!" with dis15
    mc "Mas ei, veja desta forma. Este foi apenas o primeiro encontro de muitos!" with dis15

# game/script9.rpy:20844
translate brazil ending09_843e592d:

#   l "R-Really...?"
    l "R-Sério...?"

# game/script9.rpy:20846
translate brazil ending09_85d475fe:

#   mc "Of course!"
    mc "Claro!"

# game/script9.rpy:20848
translate brazil ending09_37a60c78:

#   l "So... when's the next one?"
    l "Então... quando é o próximo?"

# game/script9.rpy:20850
translate brazil ending09_67c8a6cf:

#   mc "*Chuckles* Well, that depends on what you consider a “date”. A trip to the supermarket to buy groceries could be a date. That could happen tomorrow."
    mc "*Risos* Bem, isso depende do que você considera um “encontro”. Uma ida ao supermercado para comprar mantimentos pode ser um encontro. Isso pode acontecer amanhã."

# game/script9.rpy:20851
translate brazil ending09_ec288848:

#   mc "But if you’re only counting the more... sophisticated, over-the-top romantic stuff... then we might have to wait a little longer."
    mc "Mas se você está contando apenas as coisas mais... sofisticadas e românticas demais... então talvez tenhamos que esperar um pouco mais."

# game/script9.rpy:20852
translate brazil ending09_a1b672f6:

#   mc "Maybe the day after tomorrow."
    mc "Talvez depois de amanhã."

# game/script9.rpy:20854
translate brazil ending09_0dd91cf0:

#   l "*Laughs* I'm looking forward to all of it either way!"
    l "*Risos* Estou ansioso por tudo isso de qualquer maneira!"

# game/script9.rpy:20856
translate brazil ending09_ca03d47d:

#   mc "In any case, we’ve got our whole lives ahead of us, Luna. And I plan on sharing every bit of it with you."
    mc "De qualquer forma, temos a vida toda pela frente, Luna. E pretendo compartilhar tudo isso com você."

# game/script9.rpy:20858
translate brazil ending09_c92283fa:

#   l "*Softer* A-As do I."
    l "*Mais suave* A-Assim como eu."

# game/script9.rpy:20859
translate brazil ending09_b87fab88:

#   l "I..."
    l "EU..."

# game/script9.rpy:20860
translate brazil ending09_92ba1a18:

#   l "I love you, [mc]."
    l "Eu te amo, [mc]."

# game/script9.rpy:20862
translate brazil ending09_95b6a255:

#   mc "I love you too, Luna. More than you can possibly imagine."
    mc "Eu também te amo, Lua. Mais do que você pode imaginar."

# game/script9.rpy:20865
translate brazil ending09_d6fd678c:

#   bla "The bus pulls up to the stop, brakes hissing as people begin to climb aboard." with dis15
    bla "O ônibus para no ponto, os freios sibilam enquanto as pessoas começam a subir a bordo." with dis15

# game/script9.rpy:20867
translate brazil ending09_7603e06d:

#   l "O-Okay, this is my bus!" with dis12
    l "O-Ok, este é o meu ônibus!" with dis12

# game/script9.rpy:20869
translate brazil ending09_194c3caa:

#   mc "You sure you don't want me to go with you? I've got time!"
    mc "Tem certeza que não quer que eu vá com você? Eu tenho tempo!"

# game/script9.rpy:20871
translate brazil ending09_a56247b5:

#   l "I'm sure! It's only a fifteen-minute bus ride, and Nancy's house is just around the corner."
    l "Tenho certeza! São apenas quinze minutos de ônibus e a casa de Nancy fica logo ali na esquina."

# game/script9.rpy:20872
translate brazil ending09_73d525a1:

#   l "Save the time for another day!"
    l "Economize tempo para outro dia!"

# game/script9.rpy:20874
translate brazil ending09_98cac8f3:

#   mc "Alright, alright... but I will see you later, right?"
    mc "Tudo bem, tudo bem... mas te vejo mais tarde, certo?"

# game/script9.rpy:20876
translate brazil ending09_66bf9b5d:

#   l "Sure thing! I'll be joining the girls in Eternum after dinner!"
    l "Claro! Irei me juntar às meninas em Eternum depois do jantar!"

# game/script9.rpy:20878
translate brazil ending09_14f11f31:

#   mc "Ahh, perfect! See you there, then!"
    mc "Ah, perfeito! Vejo você lá, então!"

# game/script9.rpy:20880
translate brazil ending09_f286cb02:

#   l "Yes! Bye bye, [mc]!"
    l "Sim! Tchau, [mc]!"

# game/script9.rpy:20882
translate brazil ending09_17177a02:

#   mc "Love you!"
    mc "Amo você!"

# game/script9.rpy:20884
translate brazil ending09_d8049447:

#   l "L-Love you too!"
    l "L-Amo você também!"

# game/script9.rpy:20887
translate brazil ending09_30687ae0:

#   bla "Luna disappears inside, and you stand there watching as the bus pulls away and vanishes down the street." with dis2
    bla "Luna desaparece lá dentro e você fica ali observando o ônibus se afastar e desaparecer na rua." with dis2

# game/script9.rpy:20888
translate brazil ending09_867e58fa:

#   mct "Oh, man..."
    mct "Ah, cara..."

# game/script9.rpy:20889
translate brazil ending09_a4fb5dab:

#   mct "What a BEAUTIFUL day."
    mct "Que dia LINDO."

# game/script9.rpy:20890
translate brazil ending09_0457f021:

#   mct "Everything was so damn perfect."
    mct "Tudo estava tão perfeito."

# game/script9.rpy:20891
translate brazil ending09_788d60c9:

#   mct "The time with Luna was perfect. The train was perfect. The goodbye was perfect."
    mct "O tempo com Luna foi perfeito. O trem estava perfeito. A despedida foi perfeita."

# game/script9.rpy:20892
translate brazil ending09_bff8bb41:

#   mct "She {i}is{/i} perfect."
    mct "Ela {i}é{/i} perfeita."

# game/script9.rpy:20893
translate brazil ending09_a0e169ca:

#   mct "Damn, what a girl..."
    mct "Caramba, que garota..."

# game/script9.rpy:20894
translate brazil ending09_5ca44e17:

#   mct "I'm one lucky bastard."
    mct "Eu sou um bastardo sortudo."

# game/script9.rpy:20896
translate brazil ending09_91e92cc2:

#   mc "*Sighs* Aaahh, well..." with dis17
    mc "*Suspiro* Aaahh, bem..." with dis17

# game/script9.rpy:20897
translate brazil ending09_0d49ad35:

#   mct "Guess I should start heading back."
    mct "Acho que deveria começar a voltar."

# game/script9.rpy:20898
translate brazil ending09_159ddc21:

#   mct "Can't neglect the girls at home either."
    mct "Também não posso descuidar das meninas em casa."

# game/script9.rpy:20899
translate brazil ending09_7c34c9a8:

#   mct "Mmmmh..."
    mct "Hmmm..."

# game/script9.rpy:20900
translate brazil ending09_742e8736:

#   mct "Maybe I could pass by that new creperie that just opened...?"
    mct "Talvez eu pudesse passar por aquela nova creperia que acabou de abrir...?"

# game/script9.rpy:20901
translate brazil ending09_e5ec4743:

#   mct "I think I can guess what flavor each of them likes."
    mct "Acho que posso adivinhar de que sabor cada um deles gosta."

# game/script9.rpy:20902
translate brazil ending09_e4ea33e2:

#   mct "Yeah... they'd love that, no doubt. It's the little things that matter, after all."
    mct "Sim... eles adorariam isso, sem dúvida. Afinal, são as pequenas coisas que importam."

# game/script9.rpy:20903
translate brazil ending09_9d3a264c:

#   mct "Sure, those crepes are a bit overpriced, but hell, it's more than worth it."
    mct "Claro, esses crepes são um pouco caros, mas, caramba, vale a pena."

# game/script9.rpy:20905
translate brazil ending09_0e923dc3:

#   mct "Ahh, [mc]..." with dis15
    mct "Ah, [mc]..." with dis15

# game/script9.rpy:20906
translate brazil ending09_d1cb1070:

#   mct "At what point did you decide to fall in love with these girls..."
    mct "Em que momento você decidiu se apaixonar por essas garotas..."

# game/script9.rpy:20911
translate brazil ending09_f06e5999:

#   mc "*Kicking off shoes* Hello? I'm back, everyone!" with dis17
    mc "*Tirando os sapatos* Olá? Estou de volta, pessoal!" with dis17

# game/script9.rpy:20914
translate brazil ending09_2f0bfbc6:

#   mc "Yeah, yeah — your nose isn't lying, Dalia. I brought crepes for everyone!" with dis17
    mc "Sim, sim, seu nariz não está mentindo, Dalia. Trouxe crepes para todos!" with dis17

# game/script9.rpy:20915
translate brazil ending09_b3f56ce4:

#   mc "What can I say, I'm a romantic..."
    mc "O que posso dizer, sou romântico..."

# game/script9.rpy:20921
translate brazil ending09_a44eee64:

#   mc "*Kicking off shoes* I'm back, everyone!" with dis17
    mc "*Tirando os sapatos* Estou de volta, pessoal!" with dis17

# game/script9.rpy:20924
translate brazil ending09_b6bf9e82:

#   mc "Please tell me there’s still some food left from yesterday!" with dis17
    mc "Por favor, me diga que ainda sobrou alguma comida de ontem!" with dis17

# game/script9.rpy:20925
translate brazil ending09_344b377d:

#   mc "I spent all afternoon playing on an NBA server, and now I'm STARVING!"
    mc "Passei a tarde inteira jogando em um servidor da NBA e agora estou morrendo de fome!"

# game/script9.rpy:20928
translate brazil ending09_4b481701:

#   mc "Huh? A note?" with dis12
    mc "Huh? Uma nota?" with dis12

# game/script9.rpy:20930
translate brazil ending09_6ff418ee:

#   mc "Mmmhhuhh..." with dis12
    mc "Mmmhhhh..." with dis12

# game/script9.rpy:20931
translate brazil ending09_e4aa9581:

#   mct "Looks like they all went out. But... they're gonna hop on Eternum after ten."
    mct "Parece que todos saíram. Mas... eles vão embarcar em Eternum depois das dez."

# game/script9.rpy:20932
translate brazil ending09_10ffaf6a:

#   mct "Although... they didn't say what server. I need to ask in the group chat."
    mct "Embora... eles não tenham dito qual servidor. Preciso perguntar no chat em grupo."

# game/script9.rpy:20933
translate brazil ending09_d3e7549b:

#   mct "Or... just crash at Alex's place and join them there."
    mct "Ou... simplesmente fique na casa de Alex e junte-se a eles lá."

# game/script9.rpy:20935
translate brazil ending09_29c50b98:

#   mct "I could even bring dessert! I'm sure they’d love that surprise."
    mct "Eu poderia até trazer sobremesa! Tenho certeza que eles adorariam essa surpresa."

# game/script9.rpy:20937
translate brazil ending09_70257aad:

#   mct "I could even bring the crepes with me!"
    mct "Eu poderia até trazer os crepes comigo!"

# game/script9.rpy:20938
translate brazil ending09_a43e46a8:

#   mct "...Though by the time I get there, they’ll probably be cold."
    mct "...Embora quando eu chegar lá, eles provavelmente estarão com frio."

# game/script9.rpy:20939
translate brazil ending09_2abc3283:

#   mct "Might as well just buy new ones on the way."
    mct "É melhor comprar novos no caminho."

# game/script9.rpy:20940
translate brazil ending09_840f2d49:

#   mct "Which means... I guess I’m stuck eating these ones by myself."
    mct "O que significa... acho que estou preso comendo esses sozinho."

# game/script9.rpy:20941
translate brazil ending09_864b7852:

#   mct "Hehe... truly tragic..."
    mct "Hehe... verdadeiramente trágico..."

# game/script9.rpy:20943
translate brazil ending09_c33dbfd1:

#   mct "Alright, alright, alright!" with dis17
    mct "Tudo bem, tudo bem, tudo bem!" with dis17

# game/script9.rpy:20944
translate brazil ending09_83ed8718:

#   mct "In any case, I've still got a little over an hour left."
    mct "De qualquer forma, ainda me resta pouco mais de uma hora."

# game/script9.rpy:20945
translate brazil ending09_28a3ec43:

#   mct "Plenty of time to be productive."
    mct "Muito tempo para ser produtivo."

# game/script9.rpy:20947
translate brazil ending09_d1af3c08:

#   mct "These girls might be everything to me now, but I still need to focus on myself once in a while."
    mct "Essas garotas podem ser tudo para mim agora, mas ainda preciso me concentrar em mim de vez em quando."

# game/script9.rpy:20949
translate brazil ending09_3dad61a8:

#   mct "I’ll grab a snack, maybe read a chapter of that book I keep putting off, do a few sit-ups, clean my room, then head out to buy dessert before the stores close."
    mct "Vou fazer um lanche, talvez ler um capítulo daquele livro que sempre adiei, fazer alguns abdominais, limpar meu quarto e depois sair para comprar sobremesa antes que as lojas fechem."

